        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "richText",
            "role": "section",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Project Overview"
              }
            ],
            "level": 2
          },
          {
            "type": "stack",
            "spacing": "compact",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "richText",
                "role": "body",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "StitchFit is an ecommerce app that recommends shoppers correct fitting clothing by measuring them with AI-powered imaging technology and using their measurements to curate a selection of clothing from different brands personalized to their size and preference."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "richText",
                "role": "body",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "This case study delves into the challenges of finding the correct size when shopping online. Over a six-month period, I designed an application from ideation to prototype, addressing this issue with an innovative approach and user-informed solutions. "
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "columns",
        "spacing": "normal",
        "ratios": [
          100,
          100
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "richText",
            "role": "section",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Problem"
              }
            ],
            "level": 2
          },
          {
            "type": "richText",
            "role": "body",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A common issue with the rise of online shopping is purchasing clothes that turn out to be the wrong size. This problem leads to a higher rate of returns, creating challenges for both companies and the environment. "
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "columns",
        "spacing": "normal",
        "ratios": [
          100,
          100,
          100,
          100
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "card",
            "variant": "research",
            "icon": "images/stitchfit-clothing-sizing-icon.svg",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "richText",
                "role": "body",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Inconsistency in clothing sizing exists due to "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "strong",
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "vanity sizing "
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "that emerged in the 20th century as well as different styles across different brands."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "card",
            "variant": "research",
            "icon": "images/stitchfit-industry-impact-icon.svg",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "richText",
                "role": "body",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Sizing inconsistency in the fashion industry is an issue for shoppers, businesses, and the environment."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "card",
            "variant": "research",
            "icon": "images/stitchfit-shopping-returns-icon.svg",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "richText",
                "role": "body",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Shoppers "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "strong",
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "bracket purchase"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " clothing and return the wrong sized clothing to combat this existing issue they face."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "card",
            "variant": "research",
            "icon": "images/stitchfit-sizing-solutions-icon.svg",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "richText",
                "role": "body",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "There are some solutions towards the issue of clothing size inconsistency such as plug-ins for online retail stores as well as more experimental solutions "
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "stack",
        "spacing": "normal",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "richText",
            "role": "section",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Final Designs"
              }
            ],
            "level": 2
          },
          {
            "type": "richText",
            "role": "body",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To tackle this issue, I explored methods to improve size accuracy using both objective and subjective forms of measurements and data collection. StitchFit utilizes photo technology to measure users' sizes and recommends clothing from their favorite brands that fits them correctly. "
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
